scribe someone's appearance and personality.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":\"02\",\"columns\":\"02\",\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Words to Describe Appearance </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Words to Describe Personality </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"blonde<br />brunette<br />tall<br />short\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"outgoing<br />interesting<br />fun\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "Ann is a tall brunette. </br> She has long hair. </br> She is fun and outgoing.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "I see   ", "type": "name"}, {"content": " you use this to say that you understand ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: <span class=\"strong\">Rachel</span>: I met a woman at the cafe. <br /><span class=\"strong\">Mohammed</span>: I see.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le03ob10aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": " These are words you use to describe people.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "what does she/he look like   ", "type": "name"}, {"content": " you use this to ask about someone's physical appearance ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: <span class=\"strong\">Ted</span>: What does she look like? <br /><span class=\"strong\">Brian</span>: She is short and has red hair.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le03ob10aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "blonde/blond  ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "yellow color, used for hair ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective) ", "type": "par